verses.10:
Cross over to the coasts of Cyprus + 2:10 Hebrew Kittim 
 and take a look;
 send to Kedar and consider carefully;
 see if there has ever been anything like this:

verses.12:
Be stunned by this, O heavens;
 be shocked and utterly appalled,”
 declares the LORD.

verses.15:
The young lions have roared at him;
 they have sounded their voices.
 They have laid waste his land;
 his cities lie in ruins, without inhabitant.

verses.23:
